DAILY JOURNAL

The calendar has “Quick note for this date” and “Open journal for this date”
text actions. Both launch Micro through tam-launch-journal, using the selected
calendar day. Quick Launch and Meta+Shift+J offer today’s capture. The
standalone tam-journal tool owns plain text files under ~/Journal (or
TAM_JOURNAL_DIR); no journal content is stored in clock state or feeds.
Requires a selected assembly containing the product launcher and journal tool.
